{"0": "Annual results showed diverging trends in revenue and profit. Revenue was highest in 2022 at KRW 257.7 billion among 2022–2025, then fell to KRW 251.1 billion in 2023 (down 2.6% year over year) and KRW 207.5 billion in 2024 (down 17.4% year over year), before recovering slightly to KRW 209.2 billion in 2025 (up 0.8% year over year). Operating profit swung from KRW 21.3 billion in 2022 to an operating loss of KRW 1.53 billion in 2023, returned to profit at KRW 4.79 billion in 2024, and rose 9.2% to KRW 5.24 billion in 2025. The operating margin was 8.3% in 2022, -0.6% in 2023, 2.3% in 2024, and 2.5% in 2025. The 2022 margin peak coincided with a period of declining revenue, and since 2024 the margin has risen gradually from a low level. Net profit attributable to owners of the parent was KRW 15.6 billion in 2022, a net loss of KRW 2.23 billion in 2023 (swing to a loss), KRW 1.36 billion in 2024 (return to profit), and KRW 3.2 billion in 2025 (up 134.8% year over year). Net profit including non-controlling interests is disclosed at the same amounts for the same years. The company explained that the reversal of valuation losses and a decrease in non-operating expenses drove the 2025 increase in net profit. On a quarterly basis, revenue was KRW 52.5 billion in Q3 2025 and KRW 52.4 billion in Q4 (down 0.2% quarter over quarter), then KRW 63.9 billion in Q1 2026 (up 22.0% quarter over quarter), KRW 71.5 billion in Q2 (up 11.8% quarter over quarter), and KRW 69.1 billion in Q3 (down 3.3% quarter over quarter, up 31.6% year over year). Operating profit was KRW 1.09 billion in Q3 2025, KRW 1.74 billion in Q4, and KRW 2.36 billion in Q1 2026, then declined to KRW 2.16 billion in Q2 (down 8.7% quarter over quarter) and KRW 1.26 billion in Q3 (down 41.7% quarter over quarter). Net profit attributable to owners of the parent was KRW 1.12 billion in Q3, up 146.4% quarter over quarter; because operating profit and net profit moved in different directions, the detailed causes, including non-operating items, should be confirmed in the periodic report. The sum of net profit attributable to owners of the parent over the latest four quarters is KRW 3.93 billion."}
===JSON_END===

